<?xml version="1.0"?>
<h:html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms" xmlns:h="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:ev="http://www.w3.org/2001/xml-events" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:jr="http://openrosa.org/javarosa" xmlns:orx="http://openrosa.org/xforms" xmlns:odk="http://www.opendatakit.org/xforms">
  <h:head>
    <h:title>Skin Form</h:title>
    <model odk:xforms-version="1.0.0">
      <instance>
        <data id="ADT_FormX_SkinConditions" version="20260827124010" prefix="J1!ADT_FormX_SkinConditions!" delimiter="#">
          <inputs>
            <meta>
              <location>
                <lat/>
                <long/>
                <error/>
                <message/>
              </location>
            </meta>
            <source>user</source>
            <source_id/>
            <user>
              <contact_id/>
              <parent>
                <_id/>
              </parent>
            </user>
            <contact>
              <_id/>
              <name/>
              <short_name/>
              <patient_id/>
              <date_of_birth>0</date_of_birth>
              <sex/>
              <parent>
                <_id/>
                <parent>
                  <contact>
                    <nurse_name/>
                    <phone/>
                  </contact>
                </parent>
              </parent>
            </contact>
          </inputs>
          <source/>
          <source_id/>
          <client_uuid/>
          <client_id/>
          <client_name/>
          <client_short_name/>
          <client_sex/>
          <client_date_of_birth/>
          <client_age_in_years/>
          <client_age_in_months/>
          <client_age_in_days/>
          <client_age_in_weeks/>
          <skin_conditions_group>
            <skin_symptoms/>
            <skin_appearance/>
            <sclera_appearance/>
          </skin_conditions_group>
          <results_group>
            <calc_impetigo_folliculitis/>
            <calc_ring_worm/>
            <calc_scabies/>
            <calc_moderate_anemia/>
            <res_impetigo_folliculitis/>
            <res_impetigo_folliculitis_action/>
            <res_ring_worm/>
            <res_ring_worm_action/>
            <res_scabies/>
            <res_scabies_action/>
            <res_moderate_anemia/>
            <res_moderate_anemia_action/>
          </results_group>
          <meta tag="hidden">
            <instanceID/>
          </meta>
        </data>
      </instance>
      <instance id="contact-summary"/>
      <instance id="user-contact-summary"/>
      <instance id="yes_no">
        <root>
          <item>
            <name>yes</name>
            <label>Yes</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>no</name>
            <label>No</label>
          </item>
        </root>
      </instance>
      <instance id="skin_symptoms">
        <root>
          <item>
            <name>itching</name>
            <label>Skin is itchy</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>blisters_sores_pustules</name>
            <label>Skin has blisters, sores, or pustules</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>crusts_or_lesions</name>
            <label>Skin has red, tender, warm crusts or small lesions</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>itchy_lesions</name>
            <label>Itchy circular lesion with a raised edge and fine scaly area in the center with loss of hair .</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>rash</name>
            <label>Rash and excoriations on turoso</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>web_space_and_wrists</name>
            <label>Rash burrows in web space and wrists</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>face_spared</name>
            <label>Rash on body but not face</label>
          </item>
        </root>
      </instance>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs" relevant="./source = 'user'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/source" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/source_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/user/contact_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/user/parent/_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/_id" type="db:person"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/short_name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/patient_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/date_of_birth" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/sex" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact/nurse_name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact/phone" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/source" type="string" calculate="../inputs/source"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/source_id" type="string" calculate="../inputs/source_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_uuid" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_id" type="string" required="true()" calculate="../inputs/contact/_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_name" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/name"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_short_name" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/short_name"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_sex" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/sex"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_date_of_birth" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/date_of_birth"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_age_in_years" type="string" calculate="floor( difference-in-months(  /data/client_date_of_birth , today() ) div 12 )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_age_in_months" type="string" calculate="difference-in-months(  /data/client_date_of_birth , today() )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_age_in_days" type="string" calculate="floor( decimal-date-time(today()) - decimal-date-time( /data/client_date_of_birth ) )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/client_age_in_weeks" type="string" calculate="floor((decimal-date-time(today()) - decimal-date-time( /data/client_date_of_birth )) div 7)"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms" type="string" required="true()"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/skin_conditions_group/skin_appearance" type="string" required="true()"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/skin_conditions_group/sclera_appearance" type="string" required="true()"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/calc_impetigo_folliculitis" type="string" calculate="if(selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'crusts_or_lesions') or selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'blisters_sores_pustules'), 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/calc_ring_worm" type="string" calculate="if(selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'itching') or selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'itchy_lesions'), 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/calc_scabies" type="string" calculate="if(selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'rash') or selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'web_space_and_wrists') or selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'face_spared'), 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/calc_moderate_anemia" type="string" calculate="if( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_appearance  = 'yes' or  /data/skin_conditions_group/sclera_appearance  = 'yes', 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_impetigo_folliculitis" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_impetigo_folliculitis  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_impetigo_folliculitis_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_impetigo_folliculitis  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_ring_worm  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_ring_worm  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_scabies" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_scabies  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_scabies_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_scabies  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_moderate_anemia" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_moderate_anemia  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_moderate_anemia_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/results_group/calc_moderate_anemia  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/instanceID" type="string" readonly="true()" jr:preload="uid"/>
    </model>
  </h:head>
  <h:body class="pages">
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/inputs">
      <label>NO_LABEL</label>
      <group ref="/data/inputs/user">
        <label>User</label>
        <input ref="/data/inputs/user/contact_id" appearance="select-contact type-person">
          <label>Contact ID</label>
        </input>
        <group ref="/data/inputs/user/parent">
          <label>NO_LABEL</label>
        </group>
      </group>
      <group ref="/data/inputs/contact">
        <label>NO_LABEL</label>
        <input ref="/data/inputs/contact/_id" appearance="db-object">
          <label>What is the patient's name?</label>
        </input>
        <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent">
          <label>NO_LABEL</label>
          <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent">
            <label>NO_LABEL</label>
            <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact">
              <label>NO_LABEL</label>
            </group>
          </group>
        </group>
      </group>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/skin_conditions_group">
      <label>Skin conditions</label>
      <select ref="/data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms">
        <label>Is the patient experiencing any of the following symptoms?</label>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('skin_symptoms')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="label"/>
        </itemset>
      </select>
      <select1 ref="/data/skin_conditions_group/skin_appearance">
        <label>Does the skin appear pale or light?</label>
        <hint>Nurse to look at color of skin and sclera (eye, nail)</hint>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('yes_no')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="label"/>
        </itemset>
      </select1>
      <select1 ref="/data/skin_conditions_group/sclera_appearance">
        <label>Des the sclera appear abnormal, or tinted a strange color?</label>
        <hint>Nurse to look at color of skin and sclera (eye, nail)</hint>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('yes_no')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="label"/>
        </itemset>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/results_group">
      <label>Results</label>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_impetigo_folliculitis">
        <label>Impetigo or Folliculitis</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_impetigo_folliculitis_action">
        <label>The patient may have impmetigo or folliculutis.

Procedure:
-Clean sores with antiseptic
-Drain pus if fluctuant
-Start cloxacillin tablets if &gt;4cm or red streaks or tender nodes or multiple abscesses for 5 days
&lt;INSERT DOSEAGE CHART&gt;
-Apply antibiotic cream – triple antibiotic ointment</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm">
        <label>Ring Worm</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm_action">
        <label>The patient may have ring worm.

Procedure:
If limited to a few patches:
- Grisefulvine or Ketoconazole cream 

If extensive:
-give griseofulvin, tablets, 125 mg with fatty meal (10mg/kg/day), 2 tablets once a day for 6 weeks
-If in hair: shave hair, treat as above
-If infected (red, warm, pus) add cloxacilline</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_scabies">
        <label>Scabies</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_scabies_action">
        <label>The patient may have scabies.

Procedure: 
Treat itching: 
-Calamine lotion
Apply:
-25% topical Benzyl Benzoate at night, repeat for 3 days after washing.
-Council hygiene measures: treat all people in the household who are affected, wash bed linen and clothes with warm water and put in the sun, wash affected persons
-When infected add cloxaciline</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_moderate_anemia">
        <label>Moderate Anemia</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_moderate_anemia_action">
        <label>The patient may have moderate anemia.

Procedure: 
-Iron, folic acid – 1 tablet once a day, give for 14 days
-Albendazole (400 mg) 1 tablet
-Nutrition counseling: green leaves (panzou, lyann panye, moringa, boujon pwa, boujon manyok), fruits, rasped carots and red beet</label>
      </input>
    </group>
  </h:body>
</h:html>